    {
      "id": "u_6e1b9b88ddf8cf90fb538014_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Axios was marked as deprecated at least since April 2024 in favor of the native __TRILIUM_PH_0__ API, which is available in both browser and Node.js environments. After two years of deprecation, the library was removed following the __TRILIUM_PH_1__March 2026 npm supply chain compromise__TRILIUM_PH_2__, where attackers published malicious versions that deployed a remote access trojan. The Trilium's main developer almost got compromised, but __TRILIUM_PH_3__ not trusting unknown post-install scripts successfully avoided that.",
      "sourceHash": "6e1b9b88ddf8cf90fb538014319df5316505e27110784163c289c77f140f05c3",
      "context": "v0.103.0: Removal of axios > Reasoning",
